# Copy to .env and fill in locally. Never commit the real .env file.
#
# MVP ships with no backend and no required runtime secrets. This file
# exists as a placeholder for the day a build-time flag or a (future)
# backend URL is actually needed — keep real API keys for ads/billing SDKs
# out of the client bundle entirely; those belong to platform-managed
# config (Google Play Console, App Store Connect), not this repo.

